# chat: a question about the tool answers from the harness facts — `what can you do?` → the `what_it_is` fact; `which mode
# is this?` → the `mode_now` fact — no run (TUI-DESIGN-2 §3.1 row 7, §3.5, §8.2 chat-facts; the mock decider of §3.13
# selects `about_what_it_is` on /what can you do/ and `about_mode_now` on /mode/)
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Say hi
expect sess \$
sleep 0.2
send what can you do?
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect \[jevcode\](?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* JevCode is a coding agent
send which mode is this?
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect \[jevcode\](?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* Mode: jev-only
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
